ccNC Home @VERSION@ - install with NEMESIS
==========================================

A home screen in the style of Hyundai's newer ccNC head units, for Gen5W.
It only adds an app: nothing in /system changes and the stock home stays.

Install from a USB stick
1. Unzip this file onto the top level of a USB stick (FAT32 or exFAT), so the
   stick has NEMESIS.data and the packages folder at its root. Only one NEMESIS
   package on the stick at a time.
2. Plug the stick in once the home screen is up, and confirm the install of
   "ccNC Home". A toast says when it's done. Take the stick out.

Use
- Open it from NEMESIS Manager (Launch) or its app icon.
- Swipe between pages. Long-press a card to move or hide it.
- Long-press the date bar: Theme, show hidden apps, reset layout, open stock home.

Update: install the newer package the same way; your layout and theme stay.
Uninstall: from NEMESIS Manager, or  nemesis uninstall ccnc.home
